# Build-context allowlist for the Dockerfiles under infra/: deny everything, then re-include each image's lock inputs.
# Keeps .venv, .git, .planning, infra/.env and infra/.generated (mode-0600 secrets) out of the builder.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!packages/generator/pyproject.toml
!analytics/dbt/pyproject.toml
!analytics/dbt/uv.lock
